<title>HONG KONG: Peace Mark interim net rises sharply.</title>
<headline>Peace Mark interim net rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.08   vs  0.28 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    10.01  vs  2.21</p>
<p>    Turnover		     207.15 vs  155.90</p>
<p>    Company name		 Peace Mark (Holdings) Limited</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Peace Mark makes quartz analog watches and clocks.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings have been adjusted for one-for-five bonus share issue.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
